The getter already does a single field lookup; I collapsed the early-return into one conditional expression so the compiler can emit a branchless select and avoid a separate return path.

```cpp
    FIT_BOOL IsOpponentScoreValid() const
    {
        const Field* const field = GetField(8);
        return (FIT_NULL != field) ? field->IsValueValid() : FIT_FALSE;
    }
```